ages arising\r\nfrom the use of this software.\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2571675581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2580779729","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651#issuecomment-2580779729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651","id":2580779729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Z05LR","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T16:41:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T11:30:21Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\ncanonical name: [BSD 2-Clause License (variant 016)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[b]/README.md#user-content-BSD-2-Clause-License-(variant-016):~:text=BSD%202%2DClause%20License%20(variant%20016))\nshort name: BSD-2-Clause-016\nmarkers: General Terms Matches Marker, No Warranty Marker\ncategory: BSD\nOSI status: _none_\n\n**ScanCode**\nmatched id: [linux-openib](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/linux-openib.LICENSE)\nmatched id: [warranty-disclaimer](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/warranty-disclaimer.LICENSE)\n\n**Comment**\nThe disclaimer is equivalent to the (SPDX License Id: pkgconf). The clauses are BSD-2. As such it is a new combination. +1 to add. ScanCode matches linux-openib with a score of 100.0; this is inaccurate in terms of the disclaimer.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2580779729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2759183441","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651#issuecomment-2759183441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651","id":2759183441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86kdcxR","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T19:26:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T19:26:49Z","body":"![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fca35b3e-263c-4969-8023-b572d39ff29e)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2759183441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2759229591","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651#issuecomment-2759229591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651","id":2759229591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86kdoCX","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T19:33:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T19:33:49Z","body":"so the key differences are the omission of \"and/or other materials\" in clause 2 and the shortened disclaimer. I did a bit of an analysis/comparison below. All caps = what is in `BSD-2-Clause` and other bits are what is in this license: \n\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED [BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS] \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. \n\nThis software is provided “as is” and without any warranty, express or implied.\n\nJL: I would say this functionally says the same thing, except the `BSD-2-Clause` includes examples of implied warranties, as well as \"provided [by names]\"\n\nIN NO EVENT SHALL THE [COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS] BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\n\nIn no event shall the [authors] be liable for any damages arising from the use of this software.\n\nJL: Similarly, the shorter version here does not give all the usual examples of different types of damages, and also omits the specific langauge about different types of liability. This seems like more of a substantive difference going off my gut feel.\n\nI would be curious if anyone knows of any caselaw interpreting these kinds of differences in disclaimers?\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2759229591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2819104260","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651#issuecomment-2819104260","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2651","id":2819104260,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86oCB4E","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T17:41:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T17:41:25Z","body":"while I'm still interested as to any answer to the above question, in the spirit of not letting that hold this up, I'm also +1 to add.\n\nI think that in addition to comments above, that the \"and/or other materials\" is omitted in clause 2, that makes it the \"how\" of the obligation narrower (must reproduce [the notices] in the documentation\" \n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2819104260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{